ively. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i} & =4-2=2, \\\\ {\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j} & =7-3=4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCombining our results, we have\n\n$$\n5{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j}=5\\cdot 2\\cdot 4=40.\n$$"}]}
